  "description": "World peace is at stake and secret agent Twilight must undergo his most difficult mission yet—pretend to be a family man. Posing as a loving husband and father, he’ll infiltrate an elite school to get close to a high-profile politician. He has the perfect cover, except his wife’s a deadly assassin and neither knows each other’s identity. But someone does, his adopted daughter who’s a telepath!<br><br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll)",
  "siteUrl": "https://anilist.co/anime/177937",
  "characters": [
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 138102,
        "name": {
          "full": "Yor Forger",
          "native": "ヨル・フォージャー",
          "alternative": [
            "Yor Briar (ヨル・ブライア)",
            "Ibara-hime (いばら姫)",
            "Thorn Princess",
            "Yorticia",
            "Tornprinsessa"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b138102-ZOAu9jI2d5ke.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 170 cm\n__Occupation:__ City Hall Clerk, Assassin (Covertly)\n__Affiliation:__ Berlint City Hall, Garden (Covertly)\n__Relatives:__ [Loid Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138101/Loid-Forger) (Husband), [Anya Forger](https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger) (Adoptive Daughter), [Yuuri Briar](https://anilist.co/character/150425/Yuuri-Briar) (Younger Brother)\n\nYor Forger is the tritagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. She is a clerical employee at the Berlint City Hall. She is soft-spoken and mild-mannered, but has a strong sense of humor. She has a bad drinking habit and falls into a coma when she drinks. At home, she struggles to be a good wife and a kind mother. Although her cooking skills are not very good, she likes to keep clean and is good at cleaning.\nWhile she works in the capital of Ostania's city hall... or at least that's her civilian cover. In truth, she is an infamous Professional Killer known as \"Thorn Princess\". After becoming overly fixated on the idea her cover might be blown after a coworker ribs her about not being married or even having a boyfriend, Yor suggests to Loid a Marriage of Convenience, which he accepts, as he needs a mother for Anya for his own mission.\n\n~!As of Mission (Chapter) 44, it is revealed that Yor is part of Garden, a powerful paramilitary assassin organization operating within Ostania.!~",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "27"
      },
