        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 187 cm\n__Occupation:__ Psychiatrist, Spy (Covertly)\n__Affiliation:__ Berlint General Hospital, WISE (Covertly)\n__Relatives:__ <a href=\"https://anilist.co/character/138102/Yor-Forger\">Yor Forger</a> (Wife), <a href=\"https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger\">Anya Forger</a> (Adoptive Daughter)\n\nLoid Forger is the main protagonist of the SPY x FAMILY series. He is the top spy of the Westalian Intelligence Bureau, who is only known by his code name Twilight. In order to investigate the activities of a highly ranked politician, <a href=\"https://anilist.co/character/180192/Donovan-Desmond\">Donovan Desmond</a>, Twilight has assumed the identity of a psychiatrist named Loid Forger. Further, to appear like a normal family man and get close to his target, Loid then adopted a young orphan girl, <a href=\"https://anilist.co/character/138100/Anya-Forger\">Anya</a>, and entered a Marriage of Convenience with an Ostanian woman named <a href=\"https://anilist.co/character/138102/Yor-Forger\">Yor Briar</a>... who unknown to Twilight are themselves a Telepath and Professional Killer respectively.",
